   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Ally Financial (NYSE: ALLY) Rings The Opening BellÂ®&#xA;&#xA;The New York Stock Exchange welcomes Ally Financial (NYSE: ALLY) to the podium, today, December 4, 2024, to celebrate its 10th anniversary of listing. To honor the occasion, Michael Rhodes, Chief Executive Officer, joined by Chris Taylor, Chris Taylor, Vice President, NYSE Global Head of Listings, rings The Opening BellÂ®.&#xA;&#xA;Photo Credit: NYSE</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
